    "en": {
      "trackName": "2048 :)",
      "description": "- Swipe to move all tiles. When two tiles with the same number touch, they merge into one.\n\n- Tired of always playing 2048 game alone? We featured multiplayer mode from Game Center, you can now invite your friend to play 2048 together with you. Playing in this mode is so much fun!\n\n- Get to the 2048 tile, and reach a high score!\n\n- Get to the 2048 tile, and reach a shortest move!\n\n- 5 difficulties are available: 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096\n\n- Multiplayer game mode\nAuto match and Invite your friend.\n\n- Challenge mode\n132 challenge levels.\n\n- Obstacle mode\nAdded x2, /2, and a X for Obstacle which make this game so fun and having more challenges.\n\n- Support Game Center, added Highest Score and Shortest Move for each difficulties.\n27 Achievements added.\nReach higher number tile, higher score and more multiplayer win to unlock more achievements.\n\n- Auto game save\nGame is auto saved in every move you make and every multiplayer game you enter, and auto restored after match.\n\n- IAPP to support in game purchase\nSome of player is requested to remove in game Ads, you can do this now. And if you like our 2048 app, you can also support us by buying this item.\n\n- Classic game mode\nReach as higher number tile as you can. And beat you best score as possible as you can.\n\n\nWe'd always loved to see any reviews you make for us. Each reviews are always making this App become better. \n\nThank you.",
