      "releaseNotes": "- Minor bugs fix\n- Added a sound on/off button\n- Added a Restart button\n- Added a Resume button\n- Support Landscape mode on iPad device",
      "seenAt": "2014-05-08T09:55:39Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "- Multiplayer game mode\nAuto match and Invite your friend.\n\n- Added GameCenter Achievements support\n27 Achievements added.\nReach higher number tile, higher score and more multiplayer win to unlock more achievements.\n\n- Added auto game save\nGame is auto saved in every move you make and every multiplayer game you enter, and auto restored after match.\n\n- Added an IAPP to support in game purchase\nSome of player is requested to remove in game Ads, you can do this now. And if you like our 2048 app, you can also support us by buying this item.\n\n- Added a Classic game mode\nReach as higher number tile as you can. And beat you best score as possible as you can.\n\n- Improved the animations.\n\n\nWe'd always loved to see any reviews you make for us. Each reviews are always making this App become better.\n\nThank You!",
      "seenAt": "2014-05-16T21:40:35Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.4",
      "releaseNotes": "- Add statistic report.\nEvery played records are saved.\n\n- Add ambient music support.\nYou can listen to music concurrently while playing 2048.\n\n- Optimize multiplayer UI and stability.\n\nWe'd always loved to see any reviews you make for us. Each reviews are always making this App become better. \n\nThank you.",
